IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `poca-nouns`
IMPORT `poca-seat`

-- Cases for poca-seat.l4: one or more cases for every question, under the same § headings as the seat layer, in the text's order.  Every expected value is written from the text before the run.
-- Arguments follow the order of the question's inputs (see the GIVEN of each question in poca-seat.l4).
-- A case asserted as NOTHING is a case the Act does not answer: it is asserted as not covered, never as no.
-- Calendar facts used (2026): Monday 2 November; Thursday 5 November; Wednesday 11 November; Thursday 12 November; Friday 6 November.

`no holidays` MEANS EMPTY


