§ `What is the most I can be sentenced to? (ss 333A(4) and 334)`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for dealing with criminal property` `on summary conviction`)'s `months of imprisonment` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT (`What is the most for dealing with criminal property` `on summary conviction`)'s `ceiling of the fine` EQUALS `the statutory maximum`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for dealing with criminal property` `on summary conviction`)'s `imprisonment and a fine may both be imposed`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for dealing with criminal property` `on conviction on indictment`)'s `months of imprisonment` EQUALS 168
#ASSERT (`What is the most for dealing with criminal property` `on conviction on indictment`)'s `ceiling of the fine` EQUALS `a fine with no ceiling stated`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for dealing with criminal property` `on conviction on indictment`)'s `imprisonment and a fine may both be imposed`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for failing to disclose` `on summary conviction`)'s `months of imprisonment` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT (`What is the most for failing to disclose` `on summary conviction`)'s `ceiling of the fine` EQUALS `the statutory maximum`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for failing to disclose` `on conviction on indictment`)'s `months of imprisonment` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT (`What is the most for failing to disclose` `on conviction on indictment`)'s `ceiling of the fine` EQUALS `a fine with no ceiling stated`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for tipping off` `on summary conviction`)'s `months of imprisonment` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT (`What is the most for tipping off` `on summary conviction`)'s `ceiling of the fine` EQUALS `level 5 on the standard scale`
#ASSERT (`What is the most for tipping off` `on conviction on indictment`)'s `months of imprisonment` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT (`What is the most for tipping off` `on conviction on indictment`)'s `ceiling of the fine` EQUALS `a fine with no ceiling stated`
#ASSERT `What is the most for a disclosure in the wrong form` `on summary conviction` EQUALS JUST (`Penalty ceiling` WITH `months of imprisonment` IS 0, `ceiling of the fine` IS `level 5 on the standard scale`, `imprisonment and a fine may both be imposed` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT `What is the most for a disclosure in the wrong form` `on conviction on indictment` EQUALS NOTHING

